Ids":[730810310]},{"nodeId":730810310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1738950178,"text":"You know the kids of Vimara Village?","nextNodeIds":[730810311]},{"nodeId":730810311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":3465271394,"text":"Of course I do!","nextNodeIds":[730810312]},{"nodeId":730810312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":316491906,"text":"We all do! Arana came back and told us stories about the little Nara. Nara Iotham, Nara Bahram, and Narana are our friends.","nextNodeIds":[730810313]},{"nodeId":730810313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4227834202,"text":"Paimon's not sure that counts as \"knowing someone\"...","nextNodeIds":[730810314]},{"nodeId":730810314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":702265530,"text":"What counts, then? Do we need to \"shake hands\" after the \"introduction\" like Nara do?","nextNodeIds":[730810315]},{"nodeId":730810315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":3910946026,"text":"I know what Paimon means. Nara eat and look for \"treasures\" together. Then they know each other, right?","nextNodeIds":[730810316,730810317,730810318]},{"nodeId":730810316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4043922266,"text":"It's not quite that simple, either...","nextNodeIds":[730810321]},{"nodeId":730810321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":230516074,"text":"As long as we know each other's stories, we know each other. This is because the Aranara's world is a place for songs and dreams.","nextNodeIds":[730810322]},{"nodeId":730810322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":2125602114,"text":"#Arakavi is right. As long as we hear about Nara {NICKNAME} through songs and see what Nara {NICKNAME} looks like through dreams, it'll count as knowing you.","nextNodeIds":[730810323]},{"nodeId":730810323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":751145618,"text":"Paimon thinks that we can leave this aside for now... After all, we're already friends!","nextNodeIds":[730810324]},{"nodeId":730810324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20825,"speakerName":"Arama and Arakavi","textMapHash":4202010802,"text":"Good friends!","nextNodeIds":[730810325,730810327]},{"nodeId":730810325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1582730962,"text":"Good friends!","nextNodeIds":[730810328]},{"nodeId":730810328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2941924594,"text":"Yes. Since we're going to celebrate Festival Utsava, Arakavi needs to make some preparations!","nextNodeIds":[730810329]},{"nodeId":730810329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":2088174266,"text":"That's true. We need the Bija, right? I've sent Arayasa, Aradasa, and Arasudraka to look for Ashvattha's Concourses.","nextNodeIds":[730810330]},{"nodeId":730810330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1616529034,"text":"Spot on! But Paimon's wondering... Why don't you guys know where these concourses are?","nextNodeIds":[730810331]},{"nodeId":730810331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":3450168938,"text":"Ashvattha's Concourses are very, very sacred places. We don't usually go there. We would prefer to let the Vasara Trees sleep and dream, until all memories come together in Sarva.","nextNodeIds":[730810332]},{"nodeId":730810332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":2969899602,"text":"The forest will remember. No good thing will ever fade away, and all suffering will come to nourish something beautiful...","nextNodeIds":[730810333]},{"nodeId":730810333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":64746450,"text":"Anyway, you can find Arayasa, Aradasa, and Arasudraka looking for Ashvattha's Concourses out there. Arama, you go and help them.","nextNodeIds":[730810334]},{"nodeId":730810334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":1782535066,"text":"#I will. If Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon run into us in the forest, we can go adventuring together!","nextNodeIds":[730810335]},{"nodeId":730810335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20656,"speakerName":"Arakavi","textMapHash":3444834338,"text":"#Very well. Nice to have met you, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":730810327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2928454810,"text":"Now let's talk about business...","nextNodeIds":[730810328]},{"nodeId":730810317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3903316786,"text":"How should I explain this...","nextNodeIds":[730810321]},{"nodeId":730810318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2867429954,"text":"I eat and search for treasures with Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[730810319]},{"nodeId":730810319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1395712986,"text":"Yes! And we're not just \"people who know each other,\" but the best of companions!","nextNodeIds":[730810320]},{"nodeId":730810320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20646,"speakerName":"Arama","textMapHash":2883923698,"text":"#Good for you, Nara {NICKNAME}, Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[730810321]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7308103,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GAME_TIME_TICK","P